WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.953
- All right, so we need another break.

00:00:02.804 --> 00:00:05.379
- Okay. Can I do this now?

00:00:05.379 --> 00:00:06.654
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:06.654 --> 00:00:08.850
- Your staff has been so kind.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:09.683
- Thank you.

00:00:09.683 --> 00:00:11.040
- [Laura] Your staff has been
really, really wonderful.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.240
- I love my staff.
(audience applauding)

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.196
- And particularly I
wanna thank your IT guy,

00:00:16.196 --> 00:00:17.029
- [Kelly] Tito.

00:00:17.029 --> 00:00:17.910
- Tito.
- Yeah!

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:21.210
- Who helped me with my
phone before we came out.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.050
So, is he around?

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:23.789
- Are you giving Tito
a shoutout right now?

00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:25.415
- [Laura] I'm giving Tito a shout out.

00:00:25.415 --> 00:00:28.500
- Wait, Tito, Laura
Linney just asked for you

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.600
to come down here!

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.238
Hey, what's up Tito?

00:00:32.238 --> 00:00:33.326
(audience cheering)

00:00:33.326 --> 00:00:34.949
There he is!

00:00:34.949 --> 00:00:37.710
So, Laura wanted to
thank you for making sure

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.270
that her internet connection was-

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.430
- I just wanted to thank
you very, very much

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:42.360
for all of your help.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.666
I know you came in and
he kept my phone secure

00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:47.910
and all of that, make
sure that no one invaded.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:48.743
- That's for you, Tito.

00:00:48.743 --> 00:00:50.881
She's miked.
- That's your mic.

00:00:50.881 --> 00:00:52.413
(Kelly chuckling)

00:00:52.413 --> 00:00:55.190
- I think I know what's gonna happen next.

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:56.673
- So I just wanna say,

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.700
from me and everyone
here, you've been bunted.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.533
(Kelly and audience cheering)

00:01:06.193 --> 00:01:07.943
- That is right Tito.

00:01:08.807 --> 00:01:10.907
And a special shoutout from Audra,

00:01:10.907 --> 00:01:13.410
who, along with everybody here, thanks you

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:16.230
for giving us all peace of
mind while we shop online

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:17.460
when we're supposed to be working.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:18.840
And Laura Linney just bunted you too.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.070
That's amazing.

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:21.047
- Thank you, Audra.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:22.523
- [Kelly] It's so amazing!

00:01:22.523 --> 00:01:23.430
- Got it? Got it.

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:26.284
- I love that you were like, "ma'am."

00:01:26.284 --> 00:01:27.720
(audience laughing)

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.923
Tito, she's got a mic on.

00:01:28.923 --> 00:01:30.810
(audience cheering)

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:32.510
You are so awesome for doing that.

